  </message>
  <message name="IDS_AUTOFILL_CARD_BNPL_AFFIRM_OR_ZIP_SUGGESTION_IPH_BUBBLE_LABEL_DESKTOP" desc="Text shown in the `In-Product Help(IPH)` bubble to educate users when using BNPL suggestion you can pay over time on Chrome Desktop. Used when the possible available BNPL issuers are Affirm and Zip.">
