  <message name="IDS_AUTOFILL_CARD_BNPL_PAY_LATER_PAYMENT_OPTION_NOT_AVAILABLE_RIGHT_NOW" desc="Text for the disabled payment option button in the BNPL Pay Later tab, explaining that the option is not available right now.">
      Not available right now
